docs {
  # Verify Captcha

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/captcha/verify`
  **Auth:** None

  ## Description

  Validates a user submitted captcha solution. Upon successful verification, the challenge token is immediately deleted from Redis (single-use enforcement).

  ## Request

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `captcha_id` | `string` | Yes | Unique identifier of the captcha challenge |
  | `code` | `string` | Yes | User submitted captcha code (case-insensitive) |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "valid": true
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  * `400 Bad Request` — Missing required fields or incorrect captcha code
  * `404 Not Found` — Captcha challenge not found or expired
}
